  "paths": {
    "/": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "create service center",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "\n### 1. Create Service Center\n> **Starts the onboarding wizard.** Creates a draft service center with basic business information. Returns a `serviceCenterId` that is used to track the onboarding progress. A user can only own one service center.\n\n**`POST /service-centers`**\n🔐 **Auth:** Required — `user` role\n\n**Request Body:** `application/json`\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Al Nour Auto Center\"\n  \"phone\": \"01012345678\",\n  \"businessEmail\": \"alnour@example.com\",\n  \"yearEstablished\": 2015,\n  \"description\": \"Specialized in Japanese car maintenance and spare parts.\",\n  \"commercialRegNo\": \"1234567\",\n  \"taxCardNo\": \"123456789\",\n  \"ownerNationalId\": \"12345678901234\",\n  \"ownerFullName\": \"Ahmed Mohamed Ali\",\n  \"numServiceBays\": 6,\n  \"type\": 0,\n  \"latitude\": 30.0626,\n  \"longitude\": 31.3397\n}\n```\n\n**Validation Rules:**\n| Field | Rules |\n|-------|-------|\n| phone | Must be a valid Egyptian number (01x xxxxxxxx) |\n| commercialRegNo | Must be exactly 7 digits |\n| taxCardNo | Must be exactly 9 digits |\n| ownerNationalId | Must be exactly 14 digits |\n| yearEstablished | Between 1900 and current year |\n| numServiceBays | Must be greater than 0 |\n\n**Response:** `200 OK`\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"serviceCenterId\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\"\n  }\n}\n```",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {}
              },
              "example": {
                "name": "AutoFix Center",
                "phone": "01012345678",
                "businessEmail": "info@autofix.com",
                "yearEstablished": 2015,
                "description": "Professional car maintenance and repair services",
                "commercialRegNo": "1234567",
                "taxCardNo": "123456789",
                "ownerNationalId": "29801011234567",
                "ownerFullName": "Ahmed Hassan",
                "numServiceBays": 5,
                "type": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {}
                },
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "message": "Success",
                  "data": {
                    "serviceCenterId": "7b8829ab-2f0f-4b54-b2da-1b00236e6693"
                  },
                  "errors": null
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      },
