    "/match": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "ai matching feature ",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "# POST `/api/service-centers/match`\n\n## Description\n\nAI-powered service center matching. Analyzes the user's issue description using Gemini, maps it to relevant service types, scores nearby approved service centers by distance, rating, and car brand compatibility, and returns the top 5 matches with AI-generated explanations.\n\n## Authentication\n\nRequired — Bearer token\n\n---\n\n## Request\n\n### Body\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `issue` | string | ✅ | Free text description of the car problem |\n| `latitude` | double | ✅ | User's current latitude |\n| `longitude` | double | ✅ | User's current longitude |\n| `carId` | Guid | ❌ | User's registered car ID to filter by brand |\n| `radiusKm` | double | ❌ | Search radius in km. Default: 10, Min: 2, Max: 50 |\n\n### Example\n\n```json\n{\n  \"issue\": \"my AC stopped working and there's a strange smell\",\n  \"latitude\": 30.0444,\n  \"longitude\": 31.2357,\n  \"carId\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"radiusKm\": 15\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Response\n\n### Fields\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `matches` | array | Top 5 ranked service centers |\n| `matches[].serviceCenterId` | Guid | Service center ID |\n| `matches[].name` | string | Service center name |\n| `matches[].distanceKm` | double | Distance from user in km |\n| `matches[].rating` | double | Average rating out of 5 |\n| `matches[].serviceTypes` | string[] | Services offered |\n| `matches[].explanation` | string | AI-generated explanation in user's language |\n| `interpretedIssue` | object | What the AI understood from the issue |\n| `interpretedIssue.serviceCenterType` | string | `maintenance`, `parts_store`, or `both` |\n| `interpretedIssue.serviceType` | string? | Matched service type or null |\n| `interpretedIssue.urgency` | string | `low`, `medium`, or `high` |\n\n### Example\n\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": null,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"matches\": [\n      {\n        \"serviceCenterId\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n        \"name\": \"Cairo Auto Care\",\n        \"distanceKm\": 2.3,\n        \"rating\": 4.7,\n        \"serviceTypes\": [\"AC\", \"Electrical\"],\n        \"explanation\": \"Specializes in AC repair and is the closest approved center supporting your car brand.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"interpretedIssue\": {\n      \"serviceCenterType\": \"maintenance\",\n      \"serviceType\": \"AC\",\n      \"urgency\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"errors\": null\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Scoring Formula\n\n```\nscore = (1 / distanceKm) × 0.4\n      + (rating / 5)     × 0.4\n      + brandMatch        × 0.2\n```\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- Explanations are returned in the same language the user wrote the issue in (Arabic or English)\n- `serviceType` in `interpretedIssue` is `null` if Gemini couldn't confidently map the issue to a specific service type — the endpoint still returns results filtered by `serviceCenterType`\n- Results are limited to `status = Approved` service centers only\n- If fewer than 5 centers match within the radius, all matching results are returned",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [],
